the cut, MaskJudge.drawn_lines) that have a traced line within 1 px; precision = share of the traced inner lines that
sit within 1 px of a line of the image; outline = mean and 95th percentile distance between the traced outline and the
mask border, and overlap of the filled outline with the mask.
